                <pb facs="0464" n="384" xml:id="pg384"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">835.01/12: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Bliss</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-09-13T12:00:00-04:00">September 13,
                        1930—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received 1:35 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>131. At 11 o’clock this morning Chile recognized the Provisional Government.</p>
                <p>Norwegian Chargé d’Affaires told me this morning that he has received
                    instructions to recognize when other important powers do so and that as soon as
                    United States recognizes he will do likewise.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bliss</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
